  "body": "Ready to upgrade your lifestyle? Stop scrolling—this is the home you’ve been waiting for! Welcome to 10 Wira Lane Silverdale —where style meets comfort, and your future begins.\r\n\r\nWhy You'll Fall in Love:\r\n\r\n• Brand New & Move-In Ready: Just unpack, relax, and start making memories from day one!\r\n\r\n• Sprawling Family Spaces: 4 generous bedrooms, 2 living areas, and 3 sparkling bathrooms, including a luxe master ensuite with a walk-in wardrobe.\r\n• Effortless Entertaining: Open-plan living and dining, plus a separate family room (that can be used as a 5th bedroom). Flow seamlessly onto your deck and easy-care garden —the perfect spot for BBQs, parties, or a quiet glass of wine after a long day.\r\n• Centra Air Conditioning: Toasty in winter, breezy in summer... comfort is always in season\r\n• Gourmet Kitchen: Cook up a storm with high-quality appliances and gas cooking, whether it’s pancakes on Sunday or hosting the next MasterChef.\r\n• Low-Maintenance, Freehold Section: More time for the things you love.\r\n\r\nLocation, Location, Location!\r\n• Walk to Hibiscus Coast Station & Park & Ride, McDonald's, and local shops.\r\n• 2-minute drive to the motorway—hello, easy commute!\r\n• Close to shopping centres, cafes, top schools, restaurants, beautiful parks, and the stunning Hibiscus Coast beaches.\r\n\r\nDon’t let this opportunity slip away!\r\nOur vendor is ultra-motivated, and all serious offers will be considered – so don’t let this life\r\nupgrade pass you by. Bring your family, bring your dreams, and let’s make this your next chapter. Call me today—before someone else snaps up your Silverdale sanctuary!\r\n\r\nFeeling Spoiled for Choice?\r\nCheck out our alternative layout at 8,12 and 13 Wira Lane, Silverdale—same quality, different vibe!\r\n\r\nReady to View?\r\nGetting here is easy!\r\nExit the motorway onto Twin Coast Discovery Highway, continue to the second tra?c light and turn right onto Painton Rd. At the roundabout, turn left onto Goldwater Dr. Take the second left onto Tack Rd, 8,10, 12, and 13 Wira Lane will be on your right.",
